  s2: The dealer has two pages
  s3: The dealer has a page#59; a shared link works
  s4: The dealer has a page#59; a shared link is dead
  s5: The dealer has a page, and an admin's edit was undone
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an admin adds the dealer by hand or the import adds a page for the dealer
  s1 --> s2: the import adds a page for the dealer
  s1 --> s3: someone shares a page's address
  s1 --> s1: an admin changes a phone number
  s3 --> s4: an admin renames a page address
  s1 --> s5: the import rewrites the dealer's details
